# ---- Phase 7.0 dense FAISS indexes (local-only, ~1.3 GB total) ----
# faiss.index + chunks.jsonl + variant_manifest.json are rebuilt from
# the chunk exports via eval.harness.v4_index_builder.build_v4_variant_index.
# Variant manifest digests are recorded in PHASE7_0_FINAL_REPORT.md.
ai/eval/indexes/

# ---- Agent loop A/B harness run output ----
# Each run writes raw_results.jsonl / summary.csv / comparison_summary.json
# under eval/legacy_agent_loop_ab/<run-name>/ plus a FAISS index cache under
# _indexes/ and a console log under _logs/. Only the README and the
# tracked smoke fixtures (smoke.csv / smoke.jsonl) are committed.
ai/eval/legacy_agent_loop_ab/_indexes/
ai/eval/legacy_agent_loop_ab/_logs/
ai/eval/legacy_agent_loop_ab/legacy-vs-graph-*/
ai/eval/legacy_agent_loop_ab/smoke-*/

